{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2023-05-04 09:00:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ ANNOUNCES NEW CHAIR OF THE CANADIAN EXCHANGE BOARD', 'text': 'TORONTO, MAY 04, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NASDAQ, INC. (NASDAQ:NDAQ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF MARY ANNE WILEY AS THE CHAIR OF THE NASDAQ CXC LIMITED (“NASDAQ CANADA”) BOARD OF DIRECTORS, FINALIZING THE SLATE OF BOARD MEMBERS FOR 2023.'}